1
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:19,500
Tear through the storm and blaze!

2
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Shine, hero!

3
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:42,920
You who know the heart of justice...

4
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,500
