7
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:57,400
Now is the time!

8
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:00,400
Let's set fire on!

9
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:03,280
Put your life on the line!

10
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:07,000
Run, Thunder! Never surrender!

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,300
Tear through the storm and blaze!

12
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:15,300
You are the warrior!

13
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:28,600
I'll never forget...

14
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:31,860
